# Gitmoji commit template

#

# Example:

# ✨ feat: add momentum entry signal

# 🐛 fix: handle missing config path

# 📝 docs: explain dry-run usage

#

# Suggested format:

# <emoji> <scope>: <summary>

#

# Common gitmoji shortcuts:

# ✨ feat - new feature

# 🐛 fix - bug fix

# 📝 docs - documentation only

# ♻️ refactor - code change without behavior change

# ✅ test - add or update tests

# 🔧 chore - maintenance / tooling

# 🎨 style - formatting / presentation

#

# Write your commit message below:
